IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT EMP-FILE
    ASSIGN TO "EMPLOYEE.TXT"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
    FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD EMP-FILE.

01 EMP-RECORD.
   05 EMP-ID       PIC 9(5).
   05 EMP-NAME     PIC X(10).
   05 EMP-BASIC    PIC 9(6).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-STATUS       PIC XX.
01 WS-EOF          PIC X VALUE "N".

01 WS-HRA          PIC 9(6).
01 WS-DA           PIC 9(6).
01 WS-GROSS        PIC 9(7).
01 WS-TOTAL        PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    OPEN INPUT EMP-FILE

    IF WS-STATUS NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "FILE OPEN ERROR: " WS-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"

        READ EMP-FILE
            AT END
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END

                COMPUTE WS-HRA = EMP-BASIC * 0.20

                COMPUTE WS-DA = EMP-BASIC * 0.10

                COMPUTE WS-GROSS =
                    EMP-BASIC + WS-HRA + WS-DA

                ADD WS-GROSS TO WS-TOTAL

                DISPLAY "-------------------------"
                DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE ID: " EMP-ID
                DISPLAY "NAME: " EMP-NAME
                DISPLAY "BASIC: " EMP-BASIC
                DISPLAY "HRA: " WS-HRA
                DISPLAY "DA: " WS-DA
                DISPLAY "GROSS: " WS-GROSS

        END-READ

    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "-------------------------"
    DISPLAY "TOTAL PAYROLL: " WS-TOTAL

    CLOSE EMP-FILE

    STOP RUN.